:"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0131b01","n":"0131b","t":"令轉學無學道所成堅故有學"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0131c01","n":"0131c","t":"隨法行此至修道別立二名一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0132a01","n":"0132a","t":"為滿謂不時解脫未得滅盡定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0132b01","n":"0132b","t":"覺謂盡無生順此故名分論曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0132c01","n":"0132c","t":"說慧由念力持令住故理實由"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0133a01","n":"0133a","t":"七中擇法是覺亦覺支餘是覺"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0133b01","n":"0133b","t":"於欲界有頂除覺及道支論曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0133c01","n":"0133c","t":"戒垢故由證得淨立證淨名如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0134a01","n":"0134a","t":"者如前覺說謂即前說盡無生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0134b01","n":"0134b","t":"論曰唯緣苦集所起忍智說名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0134c01","n":"0134c","t":"見為六如是所說聖有漏慧皆"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0135a01","n":"0135a","t":"來心勝心有三謂地根位地謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0135b01","n":"0135b","t":"智出後得智中作如是知故無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0135c01","n":"0135c","t":"法智及類智行相俱十六世俗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0136a01","n":"0136a","t":"論所言如實知聚心具足有四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0136b01","n":"0136b","t":"句別義謂雖散等同是染心而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0136c01","n":"0136c","t":"心不知彼心所染色等亦不知"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0137a01","n":"0137a","t":"說有是處等言既無此言故釋"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0137b01","n":"0137b","t":"我起總自體欲二執當總我起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0137c01","n":"0137c","t":"離行相為治無道邪道餘道退"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0138a01","n":"0138a","t":"緣九智為境除法智道智能緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T29n1558_p0138b01","n":"0138b",